  "body": "## What changed\r\n\r\n- Add lead-in and lead-out controls to 2D Chamfer.\r\n- Reuse the existing `Lead` values, shape constructors, UI selectors, DTO values, and stamp writers.\r\n- Reuse the existing linear, quarter-arc, tangential, and perpendicular lead geometry.\r\n- Add Chamfer-specific air-side planning, lead halving, crossing checks, and a hard refusal when no safe lead fits.\r\n- Check each candidate lead with the complete cutter, including the cone, flute, shank, modelled body, and holder.\r\n- Keep `EdgeBreak` credit on the selected edge. Lead moves add no extra edge-break credit.\r\n- Keep old saved open Chamfer projects on their fixed-width approach.\r\n- Default new operations to a 3 mm Perpendicular lead-in and mirror it for lead-out; `None` remains selectable.\r\n\r\nThe Chamfer page adds only the lead-in and lead-out shape controls. It does not add Contour entry, level links, tabs, cutter compensation, overlap, extensions, or vertical lead-in controls.\r\n\r\n## Breaking project-format change\r\n\r\nProject format v83 carries the Chamfer lead values.\r\n\r\n- An older reader must refuse a v83 file.\r\n- A v82-or-earlier file with no lead field keeps the legacy open-chain approach.\r\n- An explicit `none` value removes the added XY lead.\r\n\r\nThe project-format break is stated in the PR title.\r\n\r\n## Tests\r\n\r\n- Focused motion pins: 7 passed.\r\n- Focused app project and stamp pins: 3 passed.\r\n- MCP create, edit, save, load, and reset pin: 1 passed.\r\n- UI compatibility and undo pins: 2 passed.\r\n- The complete motion Chamfer suites, app Chamfer suites, and UI structural field test passed.\r\n- Final quick gate: 821 of 822 steps passed.\r\n  - `mcp_live` failed on `the_bridge_copies_stdio_to_a_live_session_and_back`.\r\n  - The failed step passed on a targeted rerun: 1 step, 0 failed, 0 stalled.\r\n  - The rerun took 72 seconds.\r\n- `example_catalog`: 43 passed, 4 ignored.\r\n- `example_catalog_adaptive`: 1 passed.\r\n- `example_catalog_edge_work`: 1 passed.\r\n- Light lane: 11 tests passed across 6 steps.\r\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed.\r\n- No PR-owned golden changed.\r\n\r\n## Not exercised\r\n\r\n- No full manual application click-through ran.\r\n- The full heavy lanes did not run. This is a P6 enhancement, and the current review rules do not require them.\r\n- `graphify update` could not run because `graphify` is not on `PATH`.\r\n\r\nChangelog: 2D Chamfer can reuse the existing lead-in and lead-out controls, with cone-safe entry and exit.\r\n\r\nEffort: high\r\n\r\nFixes #3237\r\n\r\n",
